# Portfolio (always)

Personal site for Vamsi Batchu. Prefer craft + interaction over generic case-study chrome.

## Stack

React 19 + TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind v4, React Router, framer-motion. Matter.js (experiments), Three.js (some lab/about pieces).

## Routes

| Path | Page |
| --- | --- |
| `/` | Landing (outside shell) |
| `/home` | Home |
| `/work` | Work (stub) |
| `/experiments` | Experiments |
| `/writing` | Writing archive + editor |
| `/about` | About |

`src/App.tsx` + `src/pages/*` inside `Layout` (except Landing).

## Source layout

| Path | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `src/components/` | Shared chrome (`Layout`, `Mark`, `ApiDoc`, …) |
| `src/features/experiments/` | BrowserField fleet + physics |
| `src/features/writing/` | `WritingEditor` |
| `src/features/home/` | `CreativeTextRow`, `creativeFlow.ts`, layout helpers |
| `src/lab/` | Unused prototypes — **not routed**; don’t treat as production |
| `src/data/` | Content JSON + loaders |
| `src/assets/stills/` | Shared stills (Home + Writing figures) |
| `src/assets/experiments/videos/` | Experiment preview mp4s |

## Design defaults

- JetBrains Mono; lowercase UI labels; white shell; pastel `Mark` accents
- Prefer existing patterns; avoid generic AI looks (purple gradients, cream+serif, dense broadsheet)
- **Viewport chrome**: desktop (`lg+`) sticky top nav; mobile bottom tab bar (`src/data/nav.ts`). Same routes/content — do not duplicate pages. Hide mobile bar when shell overlay is open (writing editor).
- **Shell gutters**: use `src/components/shellLayout.ts` (`shellPadX` = `px-4 lg:px-10`, `max-w-6xl`). Don’t invent per-page mobile padding; full-bleed via `shellBleedX` only.

## Content extension points

- **Writing** → `src/data/writing-articles/<id>.json` + `columns.json` (see writing rule)
- **Experiments** → `src/data/experiments.json` + videos folder
- **Home posters** → `stills/` + `src/features/home/creativeFlow.ts`

Do **not** hardcode new posts/experiments into page JSX. Start: `AGENTS.md`. Vision/changelog: `overview.md`.
